From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Picocom <support@picocom.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] tools: create_pbl: remove unused file_size variable

The file size is calculated and decremented in add_cpy_cmd(), but never
read. GCC 15 diagnoses this as -Wunused-but-set-variable, and qoriq-atf
builds with -Werror.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [local compatibility fix]
---
 tools/nxp/create_pbl/create_pbl.c | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/nxp/create_pbl/create_pbl.c b/tools/nxp/create_pbl/create_pbl.c
index c277e391a..8281affab 100644
--- a/tools/nxp/create_pbl/create_pbl.c
+++ b/tools/nxp/create_pbl/create_pbl.c
@@ -616,1 +616,0 @@
-	int file_size;
@@ -631,1 +630,0 @@
-	file_size = get_filesize(pblimg.sec_imgnm);
@@ -682,1 +680,0 @@
-		file_size -= MAX_PBI_DATA_LEN_BYTE;
-- 
2.43.0
